# Authentication and authorization

Authentication establishes identity; it does not grant resource access.
Authorize sensitive operations on the server, apply least privilege, avoid
account-enumeration leaks, rate-limit abuse-sensitive endpoints, and never log
credentials or tokens. Feature RDs identify actors, permissions, denials,
recovery flows, and security test cases.
